ec des sections spécifiques pour les costumes, les cravates et les chemises, tandis que ceux pour femmes peuvent mettre l’accent sur les compartiments pour les robes, les chaussures et les accessoires. Les femmes ont souvent une collection plus diversifiée de chaussures que les hommes.',NULL,'2026-02-09 15:27:11','2026-02-09 15:27:11','d75f16dd-64a5-47eb-a13b-290285cd85af','sitemap',80,NULL),('0fbbd443-3d19-4c90-984e-c17bd1a435e4',NULL,'296a8f2c-2cc9-45af-9d6e-100b87ff6e43','image url: https drmaxisliterie re assets resources products 64767ec9 f6ba 4800 ac11 c0855ebd709e jpg',NULL,'2026-03-20 12:25:34','2026-03-20 12:25:34','3bb879f9-b0fd-4b5d-b256-dd7052e876db','woocommerce',11,'{\"type\": \"statistical_alias\", \"field\": \"image_url\", \"value\": \"https://drmaxisliterie.re/assets/resources/products/64767ec9-f6ba-4800-ac11-c0855ebd709e.jpg\", \"identifier\": \"Matelas HARMONIE\", \"product_index\": 1}'),('0fbdfb8a-52f1-4c3f-8f4f-3afdbc4bc636',NULL,'5815ed6d-02dd-4df1-9f2d-b132dd4e6c4a','emet',NULL,'2026-02-10 08:45:52','2026-02-10 08:45:52','26f613e9-bd9c-4ee3-b194-5a84b6c1a420','woocommerce',62,'{\"type\": \"statistical_alias\", \"field\": \"description\", \"value\": \"\\\">Le luminaire Hypnos émet une lumière chaude\", \"identifier\": \"Luminaire Hypnos\", \"product_index\": 52}'),('0fbf79c9-0de3-4ce4-a3c6-48ac29a2d79b',NULL,'5815ed6d-02dd-4df1-9f2d-b132dd4e6c4a','relative',NULL,'2026-02-10 09:12:07','2026-02-10 09:12:07','26f613e9-bd9c-4ee3-b194-5a84b6c1a420','woocommerce',146,'{\"type\": \"statistical_alias\", \"field\": \"description\", \"value\": \"\\\"><strong>LA MOUSSE GEL MEMORE DE FORME </strong></span></h5>\\r\\\\n<div class=\\\"react-scroll-to-bottom--css-ikxng-1n7m0yu\\\">\\r\\\\n<div class=\\\"flex flex-col pb-9 text-sm\\\">\\r\\\\n<div class=\\\"w-full text-token-text-primary sm:AIPRM__conversation__response\\\" data-testid=\\\"conversation-turn-29\\\">\\r\\\\n<div class=\\\"px-4 py-2 justify-center text-base md:gap-6 m-auto\\\">\\r\\\\n<div class=