oir et l’évier. Plus d’interruptions évidentes via l’acier inoxydable ou la porcelaine.  Ultra-durable: Le granit est l’un des minéraux les plus durs trouvés sur la planète Terre.',NULL,'2026-02-09 15:37:58','2026-02-09 15:37:58','d75f16dd-64a5-47eb-a13b-290285cd85af','sitemap',60,NULL),('d3bc6007-71ee-47ce-8239-71d9b53fdf5f',NULL,'296a8f2c-2cc9-45af-9d6e-100b87ff6e43','2025',NULL,'2026-03-20 12:25:52','2026-03-20 12:25:52','3bb879f9-b0fd-4b5d-b256-dd7052e876db','woocommerce',11,'{\"type\": \"statistical_alias\", \"field\": \"created_at\", \"value\": \"2025-06-06 12:26:13\", \"identifier\": \"Matelas HARMONIE\", \"product_index\": 1}'),('d3bcfe10-de9d-49ed-b567-cd9cf108808a',NULL,'5815ed6d-02dd-4df1-9f2d-b132dd4e6c4a','330',NULL,'2026-02-10 10:08:18','2026-02-10 10:08:18','26f613e9-bd9c-4ee3-b194-5a84b6c1a420','woocommerce',318,'{\"type\": \"statistical_alias\", \"field\": \"description\", \"value\": \"<p data-start=\\\"327\\\" data-end=\\\"656\\\">Le <strong data-start=\\\"330\\\" data-end=\\\"352\\\">Matelas Inayya Eco</strong> incarne une nouvelle génération de literie alliant <strong data-start=\\\"404\\\" data-end=\\\"423\\\">confort optimal</strong>\", \"identifier\": \"Matelas Inayya Éco\", \"product_index\": 308}'),('d3c11cd3-47e1-4c21-89e0-284d1dc4d0c3',NULL,'5815ed6d-02dd-4df1-9f2d-b132dd4e6c4a','246',NULL,'2026-02-10 09:27:25','2026-02-10 09:27:25','26f613e9-bd9c-4ee3-b194-5a84b6c1a420','woocommerce',168,'{\"type\": \"statistical_alias\", \"field\": \"discount_price\", \"value\": \"246\", \"identifier\": \"Matelas Inayya Eco - 140x190\", \"product_index\": 158}'),('d3c16116-d373-4b7d-998c-52bf6b42b04d',NULL,'5815ed6d-02dd-4df1-9f2d-b132dd4e6c4a','description: pads isolants',NULL,'2026-02-10 10:07:21','2026-02-10 10:07:21','26f613e9-bd9c-4ee3-b194-5a84b6c1a420','woocommerce',310,'{\"type\": \"statistical_alias\", \"field\": \"description\", \"value\": \"pads isolants\", \"identifier\": \"Matelas  Inayya Luxury\", \"product_index\": 300}'),('d3c1cb8e-1d7f-4